# Erebus curated tool set (live-build: config/package-lists/erebus.list.chroot).
# Keep this minimal — add tools by name, never pull giant metapackages. (Research doc §7.)

# base + a tiny GUI (omit xorg/openbox for a CLI-only image)
kali-linux-core
xorg
openbox
python3
python3-pip
git

# recon / scanning
nmap
# nuclei, httpx, naabu: installed via pdtm on first boot (not in Debian/Kali repos pinned)

# wireless fleet (§5) — needs the right USB adapters at runtime
aircrack-ng
hcxtools
hcxdumptool
reaver
bettercap
bluez
libnfc-bin
mfoc
# proxmark3   # uncomment if your image targets RFID research

# credentials / cracking (§6)
hashcat
john
# rainbowcrack / tables fetched on first boot, not baked in

# exploit data
exploitdb
